UID:38726-1794137400-1794146400@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:Where Welcome Grows: Celebrating One Year of ONA
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Come celebrate a year of wider welcome at COA! \nOn Sunday\, November 8 at 11:30 AM\, we’re celebrating with an afternoon of music\, magic\, art\, food\, and community as we reflect on how welcome continues to grow. 💚 \n🎶 Bobbi Carmitchell will kick things off with music at 11:35 AM\n✨ Victor Capece brings the magic at 12:15 PM\n🎸 Deklan Lewis will close out the performances with music at 1 PM \nAnd there’s more! 🎨 We’ll invite the community to add their own touch to the art piece started at Lancaster Pride before we finish it and hang it in our building as a lasting reminder of the welcome we share. \nCome grab some food\, enjoy the performances\, make some art\, and celebrate a year of wider welcome! 🌈🌿 \n📍 1850 Marietta Ave.\, Lancaster
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/where-welcome-grows-celebrating-one-year-of-ona/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Inclusive-Church-Year-of-Welcome-Celebration-Nov.-8th.jpg
END:VEVENT
