SUMMARY:Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Book Club meets on the 2nd Tuesday of each month at 2 PM in the Narthex\, and we’d love for you to join us! Whether you’ve read the book or not\, you’re welcome to come for engaging discussions and fellowship. \nNovember 10th\, 2026: The Correspondent by Virginia Evans
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/book-club-17/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
END:VEVENT
