SUMMARY:Crafter's Marketplace
DESCRIPTION:With 20 amazing vendors\, this event is your one-stop shop for stunning handmade treasures: ceramics\, quilts\, table runners\, wreaths\, paper crafts\, and more! Perfect for holiday gifts or simply supporting local artisans\, you’re bound to find something special. \n\n\n\n\n\nSaturday\, November 14th | 9 AM – 3 PM\n\n\n\nCome early to beat the crowds! This is a day you won’t want to miss! \nTo become a vendor at this year’s sale\, email: apostlesmarketplace@outlook.com
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/crafters-marketplace-2/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Crafters-Marketplace-Banner-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
