SUMMARY:Drum Circle with Lars Potteiger
DESCRIPTION:Join Music Director Lars Potteiger for a fun\, hands-on drum circle in the Sanctuary! All ages are welcome\, and drums will be provided; bring your energy and love for rhythm! \n November 15th at 3 PM in the Sanctuary \nCome drum with us and feel the beat of community!
