SUMMARY:Apostles Academy Concert: Scott Siciliano
DESCRIPTION:Experience the artistry of organist Scott Siciliano in a special afternoon recital featuring beautiful and inspiring music from the organ repertoire. Held in the newly renovated Sanctuary at Church of the Apostles\, this concert offers an opportunity to experience the power\, richness\, and versatility of this remarkable instrument in a space designed for worship\, music\, and community. Mark your calendar for Sunday\, February 21\, 2027\, at 3 PM!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/apostles-academy-concert-scott-siciliano/
